<section>
    <h3>Recording an error response</h3>
    <pre><code class="language-php" data-trim data-line-numbers="1-8|1-2|4-6">
// Not recorded: the exception consumes the response
$response->getContent();   // ClientException on a 404

// Recorded with its status and its body
$response->getContent(false);
$response->toArray(false);
    </code></pre>
    <p class="fragment callout warn">
        Only <b>fully received</b> responses are written. A response destroyed without being read, cancelled,
        or consumed through the exception is not recorded: on replay, the test fails clearly instead of receiving an empty body.
    </p>
</section>
